                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-4">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">How long does company registration take in Bangalore?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>7-10 working days from SPICe+ filing with complete documents. Name reservation 1-3 days. Certificate issued by CRC upon successful verification.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-5">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">Can foreign nationals be directors in a Bangalore company?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Yes. Foreign nationals can be directors and shareholders provided at least one director is an Indian resident (120+ days in India). Foreign directors submit notarised and apostilled passport copies. FDI under automatic route in most sectors.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-6">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">Is statutory audit mandatory for all Pvt Ltd companies?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Yes. Under Section 139, every Pvt Ltd company must appoint a statutory auditor within 30 days of incorporation, irrespective of turnover. Key difference from LLPs where audit is only mandatory above Rs 40 lakh.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-7">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">What Karnataka-specific registrations are needed after incorporation?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Karnataka PTRC via e-Prerana portal for companies with employees, Karnataka Shops & Establishments Act via e-Karmika portal, and optionally Karnataka Startup Cell registration for Elevate grants and Rs 100 crore VC fund.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-8">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">What are annual compliance requirements for a Bangalore Pvt Ltd?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>File AOC-4 (financials) and MGT-7 (annual return) with RoC annually. Statutory audit before filing. ITR by 31 October. Karnataka PTRC monthly remittance and annual PT return by 30 April. Minimum 4 board meetings per year.</p></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


            <!-- Quick Answers -->
            <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top:32px;">
                <p><strong>Quick Answers</strong></p>
                <p><strong>Bangalore mein company registration kaise karein?</strong> MCA portal par SPICe+ form file karke. DSC, DIN, aur naam reservation pehle. 7-10 din mein Certificate of Incorporation mil jaata hai.</p><p><strong>Company register karne mein kitna kharcha aata hai?</strong> Bangalore mein Pvt Ltd registration Rs 7,000 se Rs 20,000 tak - government fees, Karnataka stamp duty, aur professional charges milakar.</p><p><strong>Kya Pvt Ltd mein audit zaroori hai?</strong> Haan, har Pvt Ltd company ko statutory auditor appoint karna mandatory hai within 30 days, chahe turnover kitna bhi ho.</p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

